personal land yacht

g/carrier

This wind-powered vehicle is used on worlds with
typically flat terrain and reliable winds. It is capable of
traversing great distances with favourable winds but
while a passenger can be carried, its cargo capacity
while doing so is non-existent.

A grav carrier is effectively a flying armoured personnel
carrier and is a standard fighting vehicle of many
military forces across Charted Space.

AFV, Autopilot, Communications System
(advanced), Computer/5, Navigation (advanced),
Sensor System (advanced).
